WEBVTT

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:01.306
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.144 --> 00:00:05.601
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>If</b> we <b>get</b> to the airport early, the flight <b>will be</b> delayed.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.947
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>If</b> you <b>tell</b> her the truth, she <b>won’t believe</b> you.

00:00:11.482 --> 00:00:13.767
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What <b>will</b> you <b>do if</b> you <b>don’t find</b> a job?

00:00:15.866 --> 00:00:16.551
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.425
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>If</b> you <b>don’t go</b>, she <b>won’t be</b> very pleased.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.313
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She <b>won’t be</b> very pleased <b>if</b> you <b>don’t go</b>.

00:00:26.297 --> 00:00:27.101
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:28.108 --> 00:00:30.945
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> <b>If</b> you <b>miss</b> the last bus, <b>get</b> a taxi.

00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:35.233
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>If</b> you <b>miss</b> the last bus, you <b>can get</b> a taxi.